; Zen gather/scatter costs when AVX512VL is unavailable, so the narrow EVEX
; encodings cannot be used. CodeGen then widens most sub-512-bit shapes and
; masks off the surplus lanes, and scalarises the v4i64 qword-indexed gather.
; The cost must follow whichever happens, never the narrow form it cannot use.
;
; The NOVL-ASM run reads back the lowering. A shape that already needs a
; 512-bit operand does not want AVX512VL, so it must not move.

