; VL-LABEL: 'gather_v8i32_dword_index'
; VL-NEXT:  Cost Model: Found an estimated cost of 0 for instruction: %ptrs = getelementptr inbounds i32, ptr %base, <8 x i32> %idx
; VL-NEXT:  Cost Model: Found an estimated cost of 10 for instruction: %v = call <8 x i32> @llvm.masked.gather.v8i32.v8p0(<8 x ptr> align 4 %ptrs, <8 x i1> %mask, <8 x i32> poison)
; VL-NEXT:  Cost Model: Found an estimated cost of 0 for instruction: ret <8 x i32> %v
;
; NOVL-LABEL: 'gather_v8i32_dword_index'
; NOVL-NEXT:  Cost Model: Found an estimated cost of 0 for instruction: %ptrs = getelementptr inbounds i32, ptr %base, <8 x i32> %idx
; NOVL-NEXT:  Cost Model: Found an estimated cost of 10 for instruction: %v = call <8 x i32> @llvm.masked.gather.v8i32.v8p0(<8 x ptr> align 4 %ptrs, <8 x i1> %mask, <8 x i32> poison)
; NOVL-NEXT:  Cost Model: Found an estimated cost of 0 for instruction: ret <8 x i32> %v
