; NOVL-LABEL: 'gather_v4i64_qword_index'
; NOVL-NEXT:  Cost Model: Found an estimated cost of 18 for instruction: %v = call <4 x i64> @llvm.masked.gather.v4i64.v4p0(<4 x ptr> align 8 %ptrs, <4 x i1> %mask, <4 x i64> poison)
; NOVL-NEXT:  Cost Model: Found an estimated cost of 0 for instruction: ret <4 x i64> %v
;
; NOVL-ASM-LABEL: gather_v4i64_qword_index:
; NOVL-ASM-NOT:   {{v[a-z]*gather}}
